## Accessibility Guidelines

1. Always associate labels with form controls using `htmlFor` and matching `id`
2. Include proper aria attributes for custom form controls
3. Use `fieldset` and `legend` for grouping related inputs
4. Ensure error messages are linked to inputs with `aria-describedby`
5. Make form controls keyboard navigable
6. Provide clear focus states
7. Ensure color is not the only way to identify states
8. Include clear instructions and validation messages

## Best Practices

1. Always use the shadcn/ui form components as the foundation
2. Extend with Joveo design system styling
3. Group related fields logically
4. Limit form length where possible
5. Use appropriate input types
6. Include clear validation feedback
7. Show loading states during submission
8. Preserve user input on errors
9. Use proper HTML5 validation attributes
10. Implement both client and server validation